ss="sc-53f8d9c5-0 ewyCwq"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" fill="none" class="sc-1c34d5df-0 eteiwG"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 0 0-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 1 0 5.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 0 0 5.656 0l4-4a4 4 0 0 0-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg><span style="display:none" class="sc-53f8d9c5-1 bWklKv">Copied</span></button></div></div></div></section><section class="sc-26662a19-0 iXUvQa"><div class="sc-95b88e77-13 fHsSzI"><div class="sc-95b88e77-14 idmrsq"><h2 class="sc-95b88e77-15 cFHQdE">Problem</h2><div class="sc-bc4a8dd6-0 ddZmjb"><p>Cardano&#39;s most urgent narrative is becoming the Bitcoin DeFi layer. Cardano needs a permissionless, safe and always live bridge from and to Bitcoin that anyone can use and integrate.</p></div></div><div class="sc-95b88e77-14 idmrsq"><h2 class="sc-95b88e77-15 cFHQdE">Solution</h2><div class="sc-bc4a8dd6-0 ddZmjb"><p>FluidTokens, ZkFold and Lantr have designed a new product called Bifrost: an optimistic bridge that leverages SPOs security and smart contracts to support permissionless BTC peg-ins and peg-outs.</p>
